{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":57,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["义人死亡，无人关心，",{"text":"虔诚人去世，无人明白。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实义人去世是脱离灾难。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些正直的人得享平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在墓床上得到安息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些巫婆的儿子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奸夫和妓女的后代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上前来吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们在嘲笑谁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向谁张嘴吐舌呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们难道不是悖逆的儿女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诡诈的后代吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们在橡树间、绿树下欲火焚烧，祭拜偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山谷间和岩穴中杀儿女作祭物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们把谷中光滑的石头当偶像敬奉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"效忠于它们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向它们浇奠献祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂能容忍？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们在高耸的山上铺设床榻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们上到那里献祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们在门和门框后面供奉神像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们背弃我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脱衣上床，掀开床铺，与它们苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们迷恋它们的床，爱看它们的淫态。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们带着橄榄油和许多香料去献给摩洛神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣使者到远方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至去阴间寻找神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然遥远的路途使你们疲倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却没有放弃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们找到了新的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以没有晕倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“你们惧怕谁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致对我说谎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不把我放在心上，忘记我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不再敬畏我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因为我长期沉默吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要揭露你们所谓的公义和作为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们对你们毫无益处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当你们呼求的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让你们收集的神像来救你们吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"风必把它们刮去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是一口气也会把它们吹走。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但投靠我的必承受这片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拥有我的圣山。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["主安慰痛悔者"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“要修路，修路，铺平道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除我子民路上的障碍。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那至高至上、永远长存的圣者说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我住在至高至圣之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我也跟痛悔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谦卑的人同住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们心灵振作起来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不会永远指责，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会一直发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免我所造的世人昏倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因他们贪婪之罪而发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我惩罚他们，愤怒地转脸不理他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却一意孤行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见了他们的所作所为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我还是要医治他们，引领他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们和那些哀伤的人得安慰，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们开口赞美。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿平安临到远近各方的人！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要医治他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，恶人就像波涛汹涌、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难以平静的大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海浪中涌出淤泥和污物。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝说：“恶人必得不到平安。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/57.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/58.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/56.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}